{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04187","headline":"游兖部逢孔君自衞来欣然相遇若旧 · 骆宾王","name":"游兖部逢孔君自衞来欣然相遇若旧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游人自衞返，背客隔淮来。\n倾盖金兰合，忘筌玉叶开。\n繁花明日柳，疎蕊落风梅。\n将期重交态，时慰不然灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"骆宾王","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04187.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04187","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}